### ═══════════════════════════════════════════
### STEP 1: Register through gateway
### Hits port 8079 → routed to user-service 8081
### Expected: 201 Created + JWT token
### ═══════════════════════════════════════════
POST http://localhost:8079/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "firstName": "Gateway",
  "lastName": "Test",
  "email": "gateway@devflow.com",
  "password": "securepass123"
}

### ═══════════════════════════════════════════
### STEP 2: Login through gateway
### Expected: 200 OK + JWT token
### Copy the accessToken from the response
### ═══════════════════════════════════════════
POST http://localhost:8079/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "gateway@devflow.com",
  "password": "securepass123"
}

### ═══════════════════════════════════════════
### STEP 3: Access protected endpoint WITHOUT token
### Gateway AuthFilter should reject this
### Expected: 401 Unauthorized
### ═══════════════════════════════════════════
GET http://localhost:8079/api/auth/me

### ═══════════════════════════════════════════
### STEP 4: Access protected endpoint WITH token
### Paste accessToken from STEP 2 below
### Expected: 200 OK + user profile
### ═══════════════════════════════════════════
GET http://localhost:8079/api/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer PASTE_TOKEN_HERE

### ═══════════════════════════════════════════
### STEP 5: Get products through gateway
### Gateway routes to marketplace-service 8082
### Expected: 200 OK + products list
### ═══════════════════════════════════════════
GET http://localhost:8079/api/products
Authorization: Bearer PASTE_TOKEN_HERE

### ═══════════════════════════════════════════
### STEP 6: Create product through gateway
### Expected: 201 Created + product
### ═══════════════════════════════════════════
POST http://localhost:8079/api/products
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer PASTE_TOKEN_HERE

{
  "name": "Gateway Test Product",
  "description": "Created through the API gateway",
  "price": 29.99,
  "category": "API_TOOL"
}

### ═══════════════════════════════════════════
### STEP 7: Get analytics through gateway
### Gateway routes to analytics-service 8083
### Expected: 200 OK + metrics summary
### ═══════════════════════════════════════════
GET http://localhost:8079/api/analytics/summary
Authorization: Bearer PASTE_TOKEN_HERE

### ═══════════════════════════════════════════
### STEP 8: Get courses through gateway
### Gateway routes to learning-service 8085
### Expected: 200 OK + courses list
### ═══════════════════════════════════════════
GET http://localhost:8079/api/courses
Authorization: Bearer PASTE_TOKEN_HERE

### ═══════════════════════════════════════════
### STEP 9: AI chat through gateway
### Gateway routes to ai-service 8084
### Expected: 200 OK + AI response
### ═══════════════════════════════════════════
POST http://localhost:8079/api/ai/chat
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer PASTE_TOKEN_HERE

{
  "message": "What is the difference between REST and GraphQL?"
}

### ═══════════════════════════════════════════
### STEP 10: Get notifications through gateway
### Gateway routes to notification-service 8086
### Expected: 200 OK + notifications list
### ═══════════════════════════════════════════
GET http://localhost:8079/api/notifications
Authorization: Bearer PASTE_TOKEN_HERE

### ═══════════════════════════════════════════
### STEP 11: Place order through gateway
### Triggers Kafka event → analytics + notifications
### Expected: 201 Created + order
### ═══════════════════════════════════════════
POST http://localhost:8079/api/orders
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer PASTE_TOKEN_HERE

{
  "productId": 1
}

### ═══════════════════════════════════════════
### STEP 12: Verify analytics updated after order
### totalOrders should have incremented
### Expected: 200 OK + updated metrics
### ═══════════════════════════════════════════
GET http://localhost:8079/api/analytics/summary
Authorization: Bearer PASTE_TOKEN_HERE